{"id":"660928","name":"百香果排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660928/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肋排","amount":"适量"},{"name":"百香果","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肋排改刀切块。","img":"images/660928/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/660928/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生姜切片备用。","img":"images/660928/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/660928/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入排骨翻炒。","img":"images/660928/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/660928/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/660928/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水和几颗冰糖，大火煮开转中小火焖1小时左右。","img":"images/660928/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"百香果备用。","img":"images/660928/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"小时后排骨收一下汁。","img":"images/660928/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入百香果。","img":"images/660928/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"要焖十分钟左右入味即可。","img":"images/660928/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660928/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660928/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660928/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}